recommend keep-going Muster r2 (travels — a format muster-v1 record a validator set crosses a wire and is judged offline), then r3 (across a Knot) and r4 (true to the bytes), each its own signed round. A served muster · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay the maintainer's hand.
